    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcana: Heat and Cold</strong> is a wild mix of hentai, RPG Maker-like adventure (though the game wasn't made with RPG Maker), kinetic novel and occasional turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/e96840caec9565ed55de7e32b0e499db.avif?t=1753325579\" width=602 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you missed Spellbreaker and his funny companions, then I have great news for you. The new season is ready!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plot:</strong> a direct continuation of season 2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai:</strong>\u00a0scenes in manga/comic style, featuring over 80 unique images and 160 pictures in total (drawn by a person).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/858f9af2bfbfa5f25be673ea079ce0ce.poster.avif?t=1753325579\" width=602 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/858f9af2bfbfa5f25be673ea079ce0ce.webm?t=1753325579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/858f9af2bfbfa5f25be673ea079ce0ce.mp4?t=1753325579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jokes</strong>, funny situations, adventures and fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pixel hunting and grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional details about the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-7 chapters. The total duration is about <strong>5 hours</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It's not a visual novel, but <strong>the text is a crucial part of the game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the <strong>gallery</strong>, you can rewatch all the hentai scenes, without having to go through the rest of the game again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I tried very hard, and I hope you will enjoy the new season! I would be glad to hear your opinion. And by the way, to make sure you don't miss the release, don't forget...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/f88462f89603f7c78ad9a80b3ee47e29.avif?t=1753325579\" width=646 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See you soon</strong>. Take care!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcana: Heat and Cold</strong> is a wild mix of hentai, RPG Maker-like adventure (though the game wasn't made with RPG Maker), kinetic novel and occasional turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/e96840caec9565ed55de7e32b0e499db.avif?t=1753325579\" width=602 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you missed Spellbreaker and his funny companions, then I have great news for you. The new season is ready!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plot:</strong> a direct continuation of season 2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai:</strong>\u00a0scenes in manga/comic style, featuring over 80 unique images and 160 pictures in total (drawn by a person).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/858f9af2bfbfa5f25be673ea079ce0ce.poster.avif?t=1753325579\" width=602 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/858f9af2bfbfa5f25be673ea079ce0ce.webm?t=1753325579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/858f9af2bfbfa5f25be673ea079ce0ce.mp4?t=1753325579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jokes</strong>, funny situations, adventures and fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pixel hunting and grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional details about the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-7 chapters. The total duration is about <strong>5 hours</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It's not a visual novel, but <strong>the text is a crucial part of the game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the <strong>gallery</strong>, you can rewatch all the hentai scenes, without having to go through the rest of the game again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I tried very hard, and I hope you will enjoy the new season! I would be glad to hear your opinion. And by the way, to make sure you don't miss the release, don't forget...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837620/extras/f88462f89603f7c78ad9a80b3ee47e29.avif?t=1753325579\" width=646 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See you soon</strong>. Take care!</p>",
    "short_description": "I've always dreamed of being a magician. But I was never able to learn magic. But how can I explain this to the cultists, elves, bandits, and everyone else who so desperately needs that &quot;magic&quot; within me? New adventures and hentai scenes await you in the long-awaited continuation of the 2nd season!",
